<title>SINGAPORE: Orchard parade expects better 1996.</title>
<headline>Orchard parade expects better 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and hotel group Orchard Parade Holdings Ltd said on Monday it expected its performance for full year 1996 to be substantially better than 1995.</p>
</text>
